---
title: Order platform
---
flowchart LR
    customer((Customer)) --> web[Web shop]
    customer --> app[Mobile app]
    web --> gw{{API Gateway}}
    app --> gw

    subgraph platform [Kubernetes cluster]
        gw --> orders[Order Service]
        gw --> catalog[Catalog Service]
        orders --> payments[Payment Service]
        orders -.->|OrderPlaced| bus[[Kafka: order-events]]
        bus -.-> shipping[Shipping worker]
        bus -.-> notify[Notification worker]
    end

    subgraph data [Data stores]
        ordersdb[(Orders DB)]
        catalogdb[(Catalog DB)]
        cache[(Redis cache)]
    end

    orders --> ordersdb
    catalog --> catalogdb
    catalog --> cache
    payments == charge ==> stripe[Stripe]
    notify --> mail[SendGrid email]
